                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "Nice job, Devs. :)  Def worth the price (as i believe in supporting VR and dont think it makes sense for devs to work for free. I don't work for free, why should i expect them to?)\n\nThis was a good, brief simulation and my kids and I enjoyed it. I'll also be demo'ing it for others that come over since it's short and to the point.\n\nMake sure you click the start button in the beginning or you won't be able to move the game forward and pick stuff up, etc.  \n\nThanks for creating this!  PS: My 5 yr old LOVES the dog and plays the game over, and over, and over, and OVER...  just so she can hide during the earthquake with the dog.  Nice work!",
